"""
Spatial-Temporal CNN for 7-Channel EEG Data
=============================================
Architecture:
  Input (batch, time_steps, 7_channels)
    → Spatial Conv  : learns cross-channel relationships
    → Temporal Conv1 : learns fine-grained local temporal patterns
    → Temporal Conv2 : learns mid-level temporal patterns
    → Temporal Conv3 : learns coarse/long-range temporal patterns
    → Global Avg Pool
    → Dense → Output

Requirements:
    pip install torch torchvision numpy pandas scikit-learn matplotlib
"""

